Third-party components and weights
=================================

Model weights are not bundled. The build fetches these source-pinned helpers:

- nlohmann/json 3.12.0: MIT, https://github.com/nlohmann/json
  Metadata parsing; its source archive retains LICENSE.MIT.
- utf8proc 2.10.0: MIT and Unicode data terms,
  https://github.com/JuliaStrings/utf8proc
  NFC normalization only; full notices: docs/licenses/utf8proc-LICENSE.md.
- Oniguruma 6.9.10: BSD 2-Clause, https://github.com/kkos/oniguruma
  Unicode regex matching only; full notice: docs/licenses/oniguruma-COPYING.

The host links OpenSSL 3 (Apache-2.0) for SHA-256. CUDA builds use NVIDIA's
CUDA Toolkit under its own terms. Dependency source archives/toolkit packages
retain their upstream licenses; these are not relicensed as project code.
BPE, sampling, cache management and transformer computation are implemented
in Dolittle rather than delegated to a tokenizer or inference runtime.

Qwen3 protocol fixture
=====================

tests/support/text_fixture.h contains tokenizer pipeline/added-token metadata
and the chat template from Qwen/Qwen3-8B, revision
b968826d9c46dd6066d109eabc6255188de91218, distributed under Apache-2.0.
Its vocabulary/merges are replaced with a small test alphabet and merge set.
Source: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-8B
License: docs/licenses/Qwen3-Apache-2.0.txt.

